---
/** The full measures tables, folded: the section's prose carries the reading, the tables the detail. */
---

<details class="measures-detail">
  <summary>Détail des mesures</summary>
  <p class="ci-note">
    Une proportion porte son intervalle de confiance à <span class="ci-level">95&nbsp;%</span> (IC) : la plage où se trouve probablement la vraie valeur, large quand l’échantillon est petit.
  </p>
  <slot />
</details>

<style>
  .measures-detail {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-block: 0.75rem;
  }

  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    list-style: none;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .ci-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* The native marker is a triangle the sans subset does not have: replaced by text it has. */
  summary::before {
    content: "+ ";
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    /* The mono subset ships one weight: the bold summary would ask for a face that is not there. */
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  details[open] > summary::before {
    content: "– ";
  }
</style>
